## LOCKED BUILD RULES

| Rule | Detail |
|---|---|
| SplitInBatches size | 1 — permanently locked |
| max_completion_tokens | NOT max_tokens — gpt-5.2 throws 400 on max_tokens |
| No console.warn | Blocked by n8n 2.4.6 task runner |
| No spread operator | Safe only in confirmed Steps 6 and 7 — do not use in new nodes |
| pageInfo.totalRows | NOT list.length for NocoDB record counts |
| NocoDB URL inside n8n | http://nocodb:8080 — NEVER localhost |
| PATCH body mode | JSON body mode — NOT RAW |
| Webhook auth | NONE on all agent webhooks |
| CSV encoding | UTF-8 required — Windows-1252 produces garbled characters |
| Client ID at Source | Must be CSV column — cannot be introduced mid-pipeline |

